  "hard_rules": [
    "one exact ReferenceView profile and reference generation per artifact",
    "semantic model precedes rendering",
    "semantic IDs are independent of file paths lines and whitespace",
    "every selected input receives projection status and every output retains exact reference or derivation links",
    "any is explicit-source or explicit-loss only",
    "optionality nilability missing default multiple-return and unknown semantics cannot collapse silently",
    "raw restriction facets remain canonical in wow-reference and unknown runtime gaps cannot become ordinary safe types",
    "generated source uses renderer-owned inert templates and sanitized data slots only",
    "source text cannot create directives code files globals modules or paths",
    "all material generated fragments have final-byte source maps",
    "every unsupported omitted approximated sanitized consumer-specific partial or deferred semantic has a loss record",
    "reference and projection coverage remain separate",
    "Ketho is a pinned differential oracle not platform authority",
    "EmmyLua and LuaLS probes include positive and negative assertions and config mutation audit",
    "no editor settings globals libraries extensions or diagnostic suppression",
    "no full Blizzard implementation source or runtime addon packaging",
    "artifact output is deterministic under 1 2 N workers and randomized input ordering"
  ],
